DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260416
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260417
SUMMARY:🍽 Sloppy Joes
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 20 min\n\nSides: butter herb noodles / sweet corn\n\nManwich + ground beef. Done in 20 minutes. Serve with Del Monte corn.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1 lb – 73% Lean / 27% Fat Ground Beef\, 1 lb\n• 1 can – Manwich Original Sloppy Joe Sauce\, 15 oz\n• 1 pkg – Ball Park White Hot Dog Buns OR Burger Buns\, 8 ct\n• 0.5 pack – Del Monte Golden Sweet Whole Kernel Corn\, 15.25 oz (4-pack)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-04-17-meal@plan.py
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260417
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260418
SUMMARY:🍽 Birria Tacos
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 45 min\n\nSides: refried beans / sweet corn (spiced up)\n\nKit comes with everything you need. Add diced onion\, cilantro\, and lime. Dip the tacos in the consommé.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1 kit – Old El Paso Birria Taco Kit\, 12.1 oz\n• 1.5 lb – 73% Lean / 27% Fat Ground Beef\, 1 lb\n• 1 pkg – Great Value Colby & Monterey Jack Cheese\, 8 oz\n• 0.5 tub – Great Value Light Sour Cream\, 16 oz\n• 0.5 each – Fresh Red Onion\n• 2 each – Fresh Lime
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-04-19-meal@plan.py
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260419
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260420
SUMMARY:🍽 Alfredo Pasta with Italian Sausage
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 30 min\n\nDrop frozen broccoli into the pasta water the last 3 minutes. Toss everything in the alfredo sauce.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1 pkg – Johnsonville Mild Italian Ground Pork Sausage\, 1 lb\n• 1 jar – Bertolli Alfredo Sauce with Basil\, 15 oz\n• 1 box – bettergoods Pasta OR Penne\, 16 oz\n• 1 bag – Great Value Frozen Broccoli Florets\, 12 oz\n• 1 pkg – Freshness Guaranteed Garlic Bread\, 16 oz
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-04-23-meal@plan.py
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260423
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260424
SUMMARY:🍽 Mac and Cheese with Sausage
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 20 min\n\nSlice the kielbasa into coins and brown in a pan\, then stir into the mac. Add frozen broccoli to the pasta water.\n\nIngredients:\n• 2 box – Kraft Deluxe Mac and Cheese\, 14 oz\n• 1 pkg – Hillshire Farm Polska Kielbasa OR Johnsonville Polish Kielbasa\n• 1 bag – Great Value Frozen Broccoli Florets\, 12 oz\n• 0.25 gal – Great Value Whole Vitamin D Milk\n• 0.25 pkg – Great Value Sweet Cream Salted Butter
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-04-24-meal@plan.py
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260424
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260425
SUMMARY:🍽 Rotisserie Chicken + Sides
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 15 min\n\nSides: bettergoods roasted potatoes / Mediterranean grilled veg\n\nDay-of pickup — grab on the way home from Rapid Valley\n\nAlready cooked. Pair with bettergoods roasted potatoes and a veggie. Great for busy nights.\n\nIngredients:\n• 2 pkg – Freshness Guaranteed Traditional Shredded Rotisserie Chicken Breasts\, 16 oz\n• 1 bag – bettergoods Oven Roasted Red Petite Potatoes\, 16 oz\n• 1 bag – bettergoods Mediterranean Grilled Vegetables Mix\, 20 oz\n• 1 loaf – Great Value White Round Top Bread Loaf
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-04-26-meal@plan.py
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260426
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260427
SUMMARY:🍽 Sausage & Potato Soup
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 50 min\n\nSides: garlic bread\n\nZuppa Toscana style. Add a bag of fresh spinach or kale if you want to sneak in greens.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1 pkg – Johnsonville Mild Italian Ground Pork Sausage\, 1 lb\n• 1 bag – Fresh Whole Russet Potatoes\, 5 lb bag\n• 2 carton – Swanson Beef Broth\, 32 oz\n• 0.5 bunch – Fresh Whole Celery Stalk\n• 1 each – Fresh Sweet Onion\n• 0.25 jar – Great Value Minced Garlic in Water\, 8 oz\n• 0.5 gal – Great Value Whole Vitamin D Milk (for creaminess)\n• 1 loaf – Great Value White Round Top Bread Loaf
END:VEVENT
