SUMMARY:🍽 Pasta with Meat Sauce
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 35 min\n\nDouble the sauce and freeze half — saves a future dinner. Use any pasta shape.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1.5 lb – 73% Lean / 27% Fat Ground Beef\, 1 lb\n• 1 jar – RAGU Chunky Pasta Sauce\, 24 oz\n• 1 box – bettergoods Bronze Cut Pasta OR Great Value Linguine\, 16 oz\n• 0.25 jar – Great Value Minced Garlic in Water\, 8 oz\n• 1 pkg – Freshness Guaranteed Garlic Bread\, 16 oz
